WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.200
Today we will share artworks with an audience. Our work connects with our own local

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.533
community.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.119
Choose finished works and give each a title label.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:13.204
Place the works where viewers can see them without crowding.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:18.271
Guide visitors to observe one artwork and ask a respectful question.
